<title>INDIA: IMF's Camdessus asks India RBI to watch inflation.</title>
<headline>IMF's Camdessus asks India RBI to watch inflation.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Monetary Fund (IMF) managing director Michel Camdessus on Wednesday urged India's central bank to be vigilant in order to check inflation.</p>
</text>
